    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent Swiss type foundry and graphic design studio, founded late 2009 by Noel Leu and Thierry Blancpain in Lucerne; Reto Moser joined later as senior type designer. About 8 people, dispersed across Lucerne and a Brooklyn NY office. Known for widely used retail typefaces with a contemporary Swiss-tradition aesthetic: GT America, GT Sectra, GT Flexa, GT Alpina, GT Walsheim, GT Pressura, GT Super, GT Eesti, GT Cinetype, GT Haptik, GT Maru, among 20+ others, plus custom/commissioned typefaces and language extensions for brands. Established, well-regarded foundry (not a solo practice); no personal Autonomy read applies (org entry).",
